{"html":"<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 13 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">配准与投影几何：可微变换、拓扑约束和 SE(3) 闭环</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Registration &amp; SE(3)</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_067_voxelmorph-title\">VoxelMorph</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">3D U-Net 一次前向预测 dense displacement，并用可微 warping、图像相似度和平滑项无监督训练。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">Amortizes pairwise 3D deformable registration into a single U-Net forward pass predicting a dense displacement field u trained unsupervised via image similarity and diffusion smoothness.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">移动图像 m 与固定图像 f</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Pair of 3D moving volume m and fixed volume f</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">稠密形变 phi 及配准图像 m∘phi</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Dense 3D deformation field φ = Id + u (or velocity field integrated via scaling-and-squaring) and warped volume m ∘ φ</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Figure 3 · PDF p.4</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始架构图</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/30716034/\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_067_voxelmorph')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_067_voxelmorph')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"VoxelMorph original paper architecture figure, Figure 3\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/e1fb4b9da829eaf29178.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Figure 3 · PDF p.4</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 8 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_067_voxelmorph', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_067_voxelmorph\" data-call-click=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_067_voxelmorph')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_067_voxelmorph', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_067_voxelmorph\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 08 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">m 与 f</span><span class=\"lang-en\">m f</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">同维度 2D/3D moving/fixed image pair</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests pair of 3d moving volume m and fixed volume f and prepares initial tensor representations (m f).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"同维度 2D/3D moving/fixed image pair\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests pair of 3d moving volume m and fixed volume f and prepares initial tensor representations (m f).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"m 与 f\" data-node-name-en=\"m f\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_067_voxelmorph', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">m 与 f</span><span class=\"lang-en\">m f</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">同维度 2D/3D moving/fixed image pair</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests pair of 3d moving volume m and fixed volume f and prepares initial tensor representations (m f).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"把 m、f 作为联合输入，不依赖真实位移标签\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes Channel Concatenation to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"通道拼接\" data-node-name-en=\"Channel Concatenation\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_067_voxelmorph', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">通道拼接</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Channel Concatenation</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">把 m、f 作为联合输入，不依赖真实位移标签</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes Channel Concatenation to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"encoder-decoder 提取多尺度对应与形变上下文\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs 3D U-Net within the core amortized dense registration computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"3D U-Net\" data-node-name-en=\"3D U-Net\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_067_voxelmorph', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>3D U-Net</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">encoder-decoder 提取多尺度对应与形变上下文</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs 3D U-Net within the core amortized dense registration computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"卷积头一次前向预测每体素 displacement；phi=Id+u\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Displacement Field u within the core amortized dense registration computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"位移场 u\" data-node-name-en=\"Displacement Field u\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_067_voxelmorph', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">位移场 u</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Displacement Field u</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">卷积头一次前向预测每体素 displacement；phi=Id+u</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Displacement Field u within the core amortized dense registration computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"可微插值计算 m∘phi\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Spatial Transformer within the core amortized dense registration computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"空间变换器\" data-node-name-en=\"Spatial Transformer\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_067_voxelmorph', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">空间变换器</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Spatial Transformer</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">可微插值计算 m∘phi</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Spatial Transformer within the core amortized dense registration computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"NCC/MSE 等无监督数据项比较 m∘phi 与 f\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Image Similarity Loss within the core amortized dense registration computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"图像相似度\" data-node-name-en=\"Image Similarity Loss\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_067_voxelmorph', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">图像相似度</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Image Similarity Loss</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">NCC/MSE 等无监督数据项比较 m∘phi 与 f</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Image Similarity Loss within the core amortized dense registration computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"惩罚位移空间梯度，控制局部粗糙与 folding 风险\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies Smoothness Regularizer to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"平滑正则\" data-node-name-en=\"Smoothness Regularizer\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_067_voxelmorph', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">平滑正则</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Smoothness Regularizer</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">惩罚位移空间梯度，控制局部粗糙与 folding 风险</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies Smoothness Regularizer to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"phi 与 warped moving image\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces dense 3d deformation field φ = id + u (or velocity field integrated via scaling-and-squaring) and warped volume m ∘ φ via Registered Output.\" data-node-idx=\"7\" data-node-name=\"配准结果\" data-node-name-en=\"Registered Output\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_067_voxelmorph', 7)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">08</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">配准结果</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Registered Output</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">phi 与 warped moving image</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces dense 3d deformation field φ = id + u (or velocity field integrated via scaling-and-squaring) and warped volume m ∘ φ via Registered Output.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"VoxelMorph Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · 摊销形变预测的相似度与平滑目标</div>\n<div class=\"math-title-en lang-en\">Core Formalism · Unsupervised Amortized Deformation Prediction: L_sim(f, m ∘ φ) + λ ||∇u||²</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"VoxelMorph：核心公式 · 摊销形变预测的相似度与平滑目标\" class=\"tex-formula-vector\" role=\"img\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-formula-index=\"67\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"12.038701pt\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" style=\"display:block;width:auto;max-width:100%;height:auto;max-height:96px;margin:0 auto\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"-68.52394 -69.000129 259.016368 12.038701\" width=\"259.016368pt\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><defs><path d=\"M4.208378-6.084282C4.208378-6.451523 3.841137-6.729435 3.354792-6.729435C2.878372-6.729435 2.501206-6.521001 2.143891-6.084282C1.836203-5.687266 1.627769-5.220771 1.330006-4.24808H.416868L.34739-3.930466H1.240677L.367241 .23821C.1389